#: ../../source/install.rst:135
msgid "Signatures"
msgstr "Aláírások"

#: ../../source/install.rst:137
msgid ""
"You can find the signatures (as ``.asc`` files), as well as Windows, macOS, "
"Flatpak, Snap, and source packages, at https://onionshare.org/dist/ in the "
"folders named for each version of OnionShare. You can also find them on the "
"`GitHub Releases page <https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/releases>`_."
msgstr ""
"Az aláírásokat (``.asc`` fájlokként), valamint a Windows-, macOS-, Flatpak-, "
"Snap- és forráscsomagokat a https://onionshare.org/dist/ oldalon találja, az "
"OnionShare egyes verzióiról elnevezett mappákban. A `GitHub kiadási oldalán "
"<https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/releases>`_ is megtalálhatók."

